---
title: "Rates - Toad Town Services"
description: "Clear, up-front hourly rates for tech, IT, and audio/video work from Toad Town Services in Rhinelander, WI."
permalink: /rates.html
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% from "contact-box.njk" import contactBox %}
{% from "page-header.njk" import pageHeader %}

{% block styles %}
    <style>
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .rates-content {
            background-color: rgba(73, 53, 41, 0.6);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #6cc86c;
            line-height: 1.8;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .rate-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0 25px 0;
        }
        .rate-table th, .rate-table td {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 12px 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(108, 200, 108, 0.4);
        }
        .rate-table th {
            color: #6cc86c;
            font-size: 0.9375rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .rate-table td {
            color: #f0e5d8;
        }
        .rate-table .rate-amount {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #6cc86c;
            font-size: 1.125rem;
        }
        .rates-content p {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #f0e5d8;
        }
        .rates-note {
            font-size: 0.9375rem;
            color: #d9c4a5;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        .contact-info {
            background-color: rgba(73, 53, 41, 0.6);
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #6cc86c;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .phone {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #6cc86c;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .reveal-checkbox-container {
            background-color: rgba(90, 44, 44, 0.5);
            border: 2px solid #6cc86c;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px auto;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .contact-details {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding-top: 15px;
            border-top: 2px solid #6cc86c;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            nav a { margin: 0 15px; font-size: 1rem; }
            .rates-content { padding: 20px; }
        }
        .cta-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5cb85c 0%, #6cc86c 100%);
            color: #2b1f1a !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 1.125rem;
        }
    </style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    <div class="container">
        {{ pageHeader("Rates", "Clear, up-front pricing for tech, IT, and audio work") }}

        <div class="rates-content">
            <table class="rate-table">
                <tr>
                    <th>Client Type</th>
                    <th>Rate</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Business</td>
                    <td class="rate-amount">$100/hr</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Nonprofit & Churches</td>
                    <td class="rate-amount">$80/hr</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Residential</td>
                    <td class="rate-amount">$60/hr</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <p>Rates are for tech, IT, and audio work. Rates may vary depending on project scope, complexity, or access &mdash; you'll always know the estimate before work begins.</p>
            <p>I bill hourly only for time spent working. Visits outside the Rhinelander area may include a flat trip charge, which I'll quote up front.</p>

            <p>Right now I'm focusing on straightforward jobs and not taking on attic, crawlspace, or other hard-access work &mdash; if you're not sure whether your project qualifies, just ask.</p>

            <p class="rates-note"><em>Rates effective September 2026 and subject to change.</em></p>
        </div>

        {{ contactBox("Ready to Discuss Your Project?", "Reach out anytime for a free consultation. We'll talk through what you need and figure out the best path forward together.") }}
    </div>
{% endblock %}
